{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "8dc7a3acbb50f5a2cdfc1ff62a6010c639fd8332b6fa63be15a488d8d5147021", "ja": "戸惑いは唐突に", "zh": "困惑突如其来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "05e1a17478f410f9a4b665b64464e3927d763bb88c1da8041ee40fd44624a78d", "ja": "PVのリハーサルの日。監督は、4人のおし\nゃべりのシーンに物足りなさを感じた様子。\n悩む4人だが、監督のメモに書いてあった『\n秘密』という単語をヒントに、それぞれ秘密\nを持ち寄って、雰囲気作りに挑むのだった。", "zh": "到了MV彩排的那天。导演似乎觉得4人闲\n聊的场景里还欠缺了些什么。\n就在4人为此烦恼时，她们以导演备忘录上\n写着的“秘密”一词为线索，各自带来了\n秘密，以此挑战营造氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "699bb2c5f7c7fb71e771bcf7a8b2ccc4fed30a0340aad94deb44ed8061601b8d", "ja": "（今日は、新しいユニットのPV撮影打ち合わせと、\nリハーサルだ。みんな感覚をつかんでくれるといいな）", "zh": "（今天要开会讨论新组合PV的拍摄，还要进行彩排。\n希望大家都能找到感觉）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "37cced7eaf9bf94661eb0c407c7b01fdd074adb1ac25ea7bcb78cccb550e343c", "ja": "PVでは、わたしたちがおしゃべりをするんですよね？\nわたし、がんばっておしゃべりします！", "zh": "在PV里，是由我们来聊天的对吧？\n我会努力好好聊天的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "360155d7b172d58432d7b4ab5f5eb4f9298bfc2268d73714c5b1229a2a94e362", "ja": "がんばろうね、星梨花ちゃん♪　一流の監督さんだって\n聞いたし……わ、私も気合い入れなきゃ……！", "zh": "加油哦，星梨花♪ 我听说那位是一流的导演……我、我也得打起精神来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "7bc9d15a634a3d95bad47130bf0f1e4f7d133d6cf61077802c38e17e4221f6f5", "ja": "そうなのかい？　そんなすごい人を呼ぶなんて、\n{$P$}はさすがだねぇ。", "zh": "是这样吗？居然能请来那么厉害的人，{$P$}真不愧是你呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "cc809ddfa3ba27e24d06372ee10f7900e2d195b991bc6d1f9068a37087c7b9f6", "ja": "俄然、やる気が出てきましたよ～。\n相手が強いほど、試合は燃えますからな～。", "zh": "我突然干劲十足了～对手越强，比赛就越让人热血沸腾嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6cfb51599a95f6f56c287d39b147f5734617f0b387ab8d83434a994572307f08", "ja": "戦うわけじゃないんだけど……気合いが入るなら\n何よりだ！　リハーサル、頑張ってくれ！", "zh": "虽然不是要战斗……但只要能鼓起干劲来，\n那就再好不过了！排练加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8e36c4a48e3255660421b70a630965913629b62f736a0e5863a8e25ade542257", "ja": "（そして、リハーサルは無事に終了。うん、\nなかなか楽しそうな感じに撮影できたんじゃないか？）", "zh": "（然后，彩排顺利结束了。嗯，应该拍出了相当有趣的感觉吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "11c1ec3fb062b5fc10f36949f6a8eb4aa048201101b3becef0adf148bac85397", "ja": "えへへ……。みんなとおしゃべりができて、\nとっても楽しい撮影でしたね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……能和大家聊聊天，真是一次非常开心的拍摄呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "61678153ffc4574ab257a0965b7cd9fd8e55b8fa8ae46904ef428b940f65fdee", "ja": "はい～。ころころと笑うみんなを\n見てるだけで、私も楽しかったですよ～。", "zh": "是呀～光是看着大家笑得那么开心，我也觉得很快乐哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "bec004831fbfdee15e9229c7fd274f24e7b9098fc2e326828d988eec9303d457", "ja": "うん、私も……♪　と、途中で止められなかったし、\nきっと、うまくいったんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "嗯，我也是……♪ 没、中途没有被叫停，\n肯定……进展得很顺利吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "d929300b7a05e69216f798e2f9d4710a132c39d8896d8a7b919ede42f4564e19", "ja": "大丈夫だといいんだけども……\nあ、こっちに監督さんが来るみたいだよぉ。", "zh": "要是没问题就好了呢……\n啊，导演好像往这边走过来了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1011_kantoku", "source_sha256": "37153ec1c416eb929aadde6a067fd6f128c0334476e9b931072bd1e6c57df4a2", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。悪くなかったわ！\n楽しそうで、私もつられて笑顔になっちゃった。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。表现得挺不错嘛！\n看你们那么开心，我也忍不住跟着笑了出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1012_kantoku", "source_sha256": "be13bcaa91b55db98c8f9cff6c1f143d338ec3785128d3f7274e34f7fc7caf8a", "ja": "けど、今のおしゃべりのシーンも素敵だったけど……\n本番では、もう少し雰囲気が出せるといいわね。", "zh": "不过，刚才聊天的场景也很棒……\n要是正式演出时能再营造出一些氛围就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "8d6c6a615ed08bd2f740debc60613bcd0aad37d04baa72144539048f9e9ef83e", "ja": "雰囲気、ですか……？", "zh": "氛围……是指什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1014_kantoku", "source_sha256": "13b5b013fdd0b9e2c645a70ba9ed4815e583b5fcb35e2c8eb55297fd40b2651d", "ja": "そう。ふわふわした可愛さだけじゃなくて。\nしっとりしていて、でも、わくわくもするような。", "zh": "对。不只是轻飘飘的可爱。还要有种沉静柔和的感觉，却又让人心潮澎湃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "0ff4b42f863a84277a6320686e0cd99d0c3ce5879259368b5b54b58db40d8b62", "ja": "しっとりして……？", "zh": "柔和的感觉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "a04fbdcb27277b40196d90955c58b68dc5bd36aa704751e6d2a413696d29699d", "ja": "わくわく……？", "zh": "期待满满……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1017_kantokunomaneja", "source_sha256": "ae74b8196d0b6f44559906e115cd07fcc4fc85f34be84dc8bb4a2a6674f8d6af", "ja": "すみません、監督。\nそろそろ次の現場に移動する時間で……。", "zh": "抱歉，导演。\n差不多该出发去下一个现场了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1018_kantoku", "source_sha256": "06f17b32ae59f86f32292e6fecaad4fcbda6ad990322821d11fcce93baa21dfb", "ja": "あら、もう？　残念だけど時間がないみたいね……\n本番は、今日以上に魅力的なみんなを期待しているわ！", "zh": "哎呀，已经到了吗？真遗憾，好像没时间了呢……\n正式演出时，期待大家展现出比今天更加迷人的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1019_kantoku", "source_sha256": "d81435cac3afacde621658cdc3a86b18bb5a576990f2895c9c0094b70c3b13ea", "ja": "必要な事は、この企画書にメモしておいたから……\nはい！　これはあなたに。それじゃあ。", "zh": "必要的事情我都已经记在这份企划书里了……\n给！这个交给你。那么，再见啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f02eb2b6bd75b429ba0b59ce4d46c520353055263b7aabe619da5a1ea58a9a8e", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\n確かに受け取りました。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。\n我确实收到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "7c5ae7910acb8824f3081ee27d3aa1ffce753247b1cabdfdf22897621e2a478f", "ja": "あ、あの……！\nも、もうすこし、アドバイスを……あ……。", "zh": "啊、那个……！\n能、能不能再给我一些建议……啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "bf66cc42b9bf2e3df813f74b1d1b457cb817ff25aa9d9768c8f155803bd2f0df", "ja": "行ってしまいましたね～。\n本当に、忙しい方みたいですな～。", "zh": "走了呢～。真的是很忙的人呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "3e408563ec2bba1b4708c398c62269232809426021f577e5eacdd5fb22781724", "ja": "わ、私たち……監督さんの期待するレベルに、\n達していなかったのかな……？　うう……。", "zh": "我、我们……是不是还没达到导演先生期待的水平……？呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "cd3ccd04ddd756a91414239b4f9b9995f77011cab3335f38631b0d32119c81aa", "ja": "そうだねぇ……なんとなく、物足りなさを\n感じていたってことなんだろうか……。", "zh": "是啊……总觉得，好像是觉得我们还不够令人满意吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "275c59546e7f0ffcf2f0cef77192689468bc13f6324490e69d950cc41999b6be", "ja": "でも、楽しそうなところは褒められてたじゃないか。\n本当にダメなら、一から見直せと言うはずだよ。", "zh": "不过，你那副开心的样子不是也受到了表扬吗？\n如果真的不行，对方应该会让你从头开始重新审视的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9ee2fee1da2be2b440c93c917f3a7a4868e1aac374b5cab18f749829c4479309", "ja": "物足りないって事がわかったなら、足りないものを\n探し出せばいいんだ。落ち込む事はないよ。", "zh": "既然知道了不足之处，那就把缺少的东西找出来就好。没必要消沉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "b3c0d4e944b780eda47064f545c6ae15cc80a7f611345662975e9eaa9c3015e7", "ja": "そっか……そうですよね！\nわたしたちに足りないもの、みんなで探しましょう！", "zh": "原来如此……确实是这样呢！我们所欠缺的东西，大家一起找出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "9553d7e8d9bafe614608dc1bd72ecb727f88afa57477a4cbc362e508eb00b0ed", "ja": "（ヒントは、このメモの中にあるはず……。\nリハーサルは終わったし、ひとまず劇場に戻ろう）", "zh": "（线索应该就在这张便签里……排练也结束了，先回剧场吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "596289afe265ca2d2a1343b0b0c7de2f1155c0c6c443f29923427a1c245995f8", "ja": "あたしらに足りないもの……\nいったい、なんなんだろうねぇ……。", "zh": "我们还缺少的东西……\n到底是什么呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "c1934c359af2cda22cd056265247d599e8aa684f9c935e799e9e41529b8496a2", "ja": "監督さんは、ふわふわだけじゃなくて。しっとりして、\nわくわくするように……って言ってました。", "zh": "导演说，不只是轻飘飘的感觉，还要有种湿润的感觉，让人兴奋起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "a2337a33a5a0b5be8fc84520a2dbe0cdde728e379b46fab9951541eabc2b355d", "ja": "ど、どういう意味なんだろう……？　その単語から\n読み取るのは……ちょっと、難しいよね……。", "zh": "这、这是什么意思呢……？从那几个词里读出含义……确实有点难呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "03b5fa34a7bb6fa2fbbbe7cb2f58fe2a935d79f682f7e615ff1f2af568774c9c", "ja": "もっとお話を聞ければよかったんですけど……\nむ～ん、これは難題ですな～。", "zh": "要是能再多问问就好了……\n唔～，这可真是个难题呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1de42ac5a9175566bf9cca7b225aaa927fd458a1e5e7921f4155d6843bafa42d", "ja": "とりあえず、さっきもらったメモを見てみよう。単語が\nいくつか並んでるな。恋バナ、アンニュイ、秘密……。", "zh": "总之，先看看刚才拿到的备忘录吧。上面列了几个词呢。恋爱话题、慵懒、秘密……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "a35f39bdb89598528c9da0fbadfbb50ffb6d939caf80b6699283cca2ae83dab3", "ja": "なるほど……秘密か。\n秘密は、いいエッセンスになるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "原来如此……秘密吗？\n秘密或许会成为很好的点缀吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "8c1da4253deb60d719851961435f6f9d2fd8ebd46ba29212bd2c9e00a3eaa2ab", "ja": "秘密？", "zh": "秘密？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "8c1da4253deb60d719851961435f6f9d2fd8ebd46ba29212bd2c9e00a3eaa2ab", "ja": "秘密？", "zh": "秘密？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "8c1da4253deb60d719851961435f6f9d2fd8ebd46ba29212bd2c9e00a3eaa2ab", "ja": "秘密？", "zh": "秘密？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "8c1da4253deb60d719851961435f6f9d2fd8ebd46ba29212bd2c9e00a3eaa2ab", "ja": "秘密？", "zh": "秘密？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f8b40e38c347608fae8ae1703b86333d43389ef94c0bf503e419286fede31e60", "ja": "うん。みんなのおしゃべりの中に秘密を混ぜたら、\n楽しいだけじゃなく、独特な雰囲気が出るかなって。", "zh": "嗯。如果在大家的聊天中混入秘密，应该就不只是有趣，还能营造出独特的氛围吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "1a6e99afabec492528fed5846cb536ad8b2b774d6758e993221704168415d803", "ja": "そういえば……監督さんも\n雰囲気がほしいって言ってました！", "zh": "对了……导演先生也说过想要那种氛围！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1041_035hin", "source_sha256": "953078988c30bd7b10b69e666a01c04bc5907cf74df92b3195a98d68dd5f2e0c", "ja": "おしゃべりの中に、秘密を混ぜる……\n具体的には、どうすればいいんだろか……？", "zh": "在聊天中混入秘密……\n具体来说，该怎么做才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1042_045kar", "source_sha256": "c77d3c2d53afebc2f965ae27b5ac7184b8cf170cb3a2864b950cb1997766d34f", "ja": "それなら……みんなが持っている、ひ、秘密を……\n持ち寄って、お話してみる……とか……？", "zh": "这样的话……大家各自带来、带来……秘、秘密……\n然后互相聊聊……之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1043_045kar", "source_sha256": "baecb8e85274d233347b4565d0b200d3f0d8c2729037669d833ccdc483bf08f6", "ja": "あっ……も、もちろん、話せる範囲内で……\nみんなが良ければ、なんだけど……。", "zh": "啊……当、当然，是在自己能说的范围内……\n如果大家愿意的话……我是这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "e69b619f97fe8a1f7cc0d6dfdac1a2cab04750f085917b4aa6a4f989077b5d92", "ja": "なるほど～。たしかに、自分の秘密を話すのは、\n近道かもしれません～。", "zh": "原来如此～确实，分享自己的秘密，或许是条捷径呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1045_022ser", "source_sha256": "c26819a89695a61ad48f0b4fc83acffce483ab1390eb12cd449058234adc2a22", "ja": "わたし、賛成です！　みんなの秘密を聞いたら、\nもっと仲良くなれると思いますし……。", "zh": "我赞成！要是能知道大家的秘密，\n我觉得关系一定能变得更好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1046_035hin", "source_sha256": "5345171839434888b66cd75c280aaa2c72ca6a906b67caf8c047bc45df1f1ab0", "ja": "あたしも、いいと思うよぉ。秘密、秘密……\n今すぐには思いつかないんだけども。", "zh": "我也觉得不错哦。秘密、秘密……\n虽然现在还想不到就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1047_045kar", "source_sha256": "0cb2bda11c970ce6ba0c21bb2fdd1d6cbb1e025431b19a1728247f35acfb3129", "ja": "わ、私も、すぐには思いつかないから……\n次までの宿題ってことで、いいんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "我、我也一下子想不出来……\n当作下次之前的作业，大家觉得好不好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "72cf5a7188ed83105aef0002dc05bb0d14a95cce72d69a507004359a7734ca04", "ja": "わかりました～。\nまずは、やってみましょう～。", "zh": "我知道了～\n总之先试试看吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "5c70c323421b4726a3f270aec249e221103a1d4a8b68300e4625990b8ac74746", "ja": "（問題解決の糸口は見つかったみたいだ。本番までに\n監督の望む雰囲気が出せるよう、練習あるのみだな）", "zh": "（看来已经找到解决问题的突破口了。为了在正式演出前营造出导演所期望的氛围，接下来只能好好练习了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
